  "job_B1.3.16_20261116_194715": {
    "chunk_text": "lande and \u00f0\u00e6r l\u00e6rde \u00fe\u00e6t He ferde \u00fea geond eall \u00f0\u00e6t aegiptisce land sawende Godes s\u00e6d, and \u00f0a seocan geh\u00e6lde. Hreoflige he gecl\u00e6nsode fram \u00f0\u00e6re uncl\u00e6nan co\u00f0e, wode he geh\u00e6lde and on witte gebrohte, and \u00dea gelyfdon \u00f0a h\u00e6\u00f0enan on \u00f0one so\u00f0an H\u00e6lend and wurdon gefullode, and towurpon heora deofolgild. He wear\u00f0 \u00fea \u00e6t nextan geneosod \u00feurh God, and se halga gast het hine faran to Alexandrian byrig, and Seo burh is m\u00e6rost mid Egyptiscum mancynne. Hw\u00e6t \u00fea se godspellere gegrette his gebro\u00f0ra, and s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t se H\u00e6lend hine hete faran to Alexandrian Hi \u00fea sona eoden to scipe mid him, and b\u00e6don God georne \u00fe\u00e6t he his weg gewissode. He ferde \u00f0a on scipe, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he gesundful becom to Alexandrian byrig, and bodode \u00f0\u00e6r geleafan, and Sum sutere siwode \u00fe\u00e6s halgan weres sceos, and \u00f0urh\u00feide his hand hetelice swy\u00fee, ac se halga wer hine Anianus w\u00e6s gehaten se ylca sutere, and he ge\u00feeah swa for gode, \u00fe\u00e6t se godspellere hine gesette \u00feam He gehadode eac \u00fea \u00f0ry messepreostas, and seofon diaconas and endleofan clericas. \u00dea syrwdon \u00f0a h\u00e6\u00f0enan and hine beswican woldon, for\u00fean \u00fee he awende heora gewunelican \u00f0eawas, \u00dea ferde se godspellere fram \u00f0\u00e6re byrig, to \u00f0am geleaffullum \u00f0e he \u00e6r",
